Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:01:41.40,Disclosure,,0,0,0,,AI narration | Actual app | Recorded Codex repair | 1.35x playback
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.38,0:00:03.36,Caption,,0,0,0,,Statebound checks trading workflows before execution.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.36,0:00:07.84,Caption,,0,0,0,,This is a synthetic fixture, with a twenty USDT spending mandate and zero fees.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.84,0:00:10.37,Caption,,0,0,0,,The example plan is deliberately vulnerable.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.37,0:00:11.88,Caption,,0,0,0,,No real orders are placed.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.78,0:00:16.07,Caption,,0,0,0,,Find a failure runs a fresh bounded search.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.07,0:00:20.42,Caption,,0,0,0,,The checker finds a path that spends thirty USDT against the twenty USDT mandate.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.42,0:00:23.02,Caption,,0,0,0,,These events come from the plan and fault model.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.57,0:00:26.41,Caption,,0,0,0,,The first order filled, but its reply was lost.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.41,0:00:27.98,Caption,,0,0,0,,The agent sees a timeout.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.98,0:00:30.28,Caption,,0,0,0,,A stale balance cannot prove failure.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.28,0:00:34.51,Caption,,0,0,0,,Fifteen USDT remains exposed, so a fresh purchase is not free budget.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.63,0:00:40.98,Caption,,0,0,0,,This is a recorded repair authored by the development Codex session.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.98,0:00:44.23,Caption,,0,0,0,,It queries the original attempt before buying the remaining goal.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.23,0:00:46.55,Caption,,0,0,0,,We validate that candidate and recheck it now.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.55,0:00:47.97,Caption,,0,0,0,,The mandate stays unchanged.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.23,0:01:02.65,Caption,,0,0,0,,The recoverable replay runs through the shared interpreter and a persistent SQLite ledger.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.65,0:01:06.18,Caption,,0,0,0,,When the order query confirms the fill, the acquisition goal completes.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.18,0:01:08.73,Caption,,0,0,0,,The original ambiguous attempt is never sent again.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.98,0:01:16.70,Caption,,0,0,0,,Now the lookup stays inconclusive.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.70,0:01:19.84,Caption,,0,0,0,,Statebound finishes unresolved and preserves the reservation.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.84,0:01:24.64,Caption,,0,0,0,,No violation within a finite bound does not mean the environment must let every task complete.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.10,0:01:32.37,Caption,,0,0,0,,The integration panel shows a genuine recorded public testnet read through the official Binance CLI.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.37,0:01:33.90,Caption,,0,0,0,,Trading remains unavailable.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.90,0:01:37.60,Caption,,0,0,0,,Exported evidence includes the plan, bounds, observations and replay.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.60,0:01:40.65,Caption,,0,0,0,,A separate verifier recomputes the result without an LLM.
